WEBVTT

01:34.920 --> 01:37.840
ADAPTED FROM DEMON KING
OF JINJIANG LITERATURE CITY

01:37.920 --> 01:40.800
ORIGINAL WORK BY JIULU FEIXIANG

02:28.080 --> 02:29.080
It stopped.

02:32.840 --> 02:35.400
You indeed made the thunder
and lightning gale on purpose.

02:36.120 --> 02:38.160
How dare you set me up?

02:38.720 --> 02:40.280
Although I don't have strong power,

02:40.360 --> 02:41.400
luckily, I'm wise.

02:51.560 --> 02:52.840
Don't waste your efforts.

02:52.920 --> 02:54.680
You can't swap our souls
just by doing this.

02:56.920 --> 02:57.800
Could it be…

03:05.400 --> 03:06.280
The lightning.

03:07.160 --> 03:08.000
That's right.

03:08.560 --> 03:10.320
There must be lightning to swap our souls.

03:11.160 --> 03:14.040
Fortunately, I figured it out
a little bit earlier than you.

03:15.480 --> 03:16.880
It's just a little trick.

03:16.960 --> 03:18.680
What's so hard about it?

03:18.760 --> 03:20.120
It's just lightning.

03:20.640 --> 03:22.280
I'll just summon it up again.

03:37.560 --> 03:38.920
You can do nothing about it, right?

03:39.720 --> 03:41.560
You can't use
your magic power anymore, right?

03:41.640 --> 03:43.520
You were so arrogant just now.

03:45.760 --> 03:47.880
I’m not afraid to tell you

03:47.960 --> 03:49.480
that no matter how powerful you are,

03:50.200 --> 03:53.320
as long as you’re inside
this loser body of mine,

03:53.880 --> 03:55.320
you won't be able to do anything.

03:55.400 --> 03:57.520
I won't be able to do anything?

03:57.600 --> 03:59.880
What's there to be proud of?

04:00.800 --> 04:01.840
Thank you.

04:07.400 --> 04:09.080
Swap it back now

04:09.160 --> 04:11.320
or I'll kill you right now.

04:14.080 --> 04:14.920
You…

04:15.600 --> 04:16.920
How dare you be rude to my lord?

04:17.000 --> 04:19.000
Shangque, how dare you?

04:19.079 --> 04:21.240
My lord, this fairy has offended
Heaven's authority.

04:21.320 --> 04:22.360
What should we do to her?

04:29.080 --> 04:32.440
Lock up this audacious little fairy!

04:32.520 --> 04:34.320
- Yes.
- How dare you?

04:37.040 --> 04:39.800
Let go of me! Do you know who I am?

05:06.880 --> 05:08.640
- Greetings, my lord.
- Greetings, my lord.

05:10.200 --> 05:11.600
Get up.

05:11.680 --> 05:12.960
You don't have to kneel. Get up.

05:13.840 --> 05:15.920
So being the Moon Supreme seems dignified.

05:16.680 --> 05:20.160
No wonder Dongfang Qingcang
always looks like he's a great man.

05:22.760 --> 05:24.480
- Greetings, my lord.
- Greetings, my lord.

05:28.480 --> 05:30.480
Get up. There's no need to kneel.

05:30.560 --> 05:31.600
- Thank you, my lord.
- Thank you, my lord.

05:31.680 --> 05:33.600
My lord, it's almost time.

05:36.720 --> 05:39.000
Please go to the main hall
to attend the ceremony.

05:39.640 --> 05:40.480
Ceremony?

05:41.400 --> 05:42.440
What ceremony?

05:46.800 --> 05:47.720
I…

05:51.160 --> 05:54.120
I'm busy with affairs and can't recall it.

05:55.720 --> 05:56.560
My lord.

05:57.160 --> 05:59.920
Today is the ceremony held by ministers
for your return to Cangyan Sea

06:00.000 --> 06:01.920
and officially taking over the Moon Tribe.

06:02.400 --> 06:04.400
They are all waiting for you
in the main hall.

06:06.240 --> 06:08.000
I just have to pretend to be
the Moon Supreme.

06:08.080 --> 06:09.560
Let me fool them first.

06:12.880 --> 06:15.000
I remember now. Let's go.

06:17.400 --> 06:18.800
Let me guess.

06:18.880 --> 06:21.640
Is the main hall on the left or right?

06:23.040 --> 06:23.920
My lord.

06:29.160 --> 06:30.520
You lead the way.

06:33.280 --> 06:35.080
What are you waiting for? Hurry up and go.

06:37.440 --> 06:38.360
Yes.

06:51.080 --> 06:52.200
- My lord.
- My lord.

06:57.720 --> 07:03.080
SILENT MOON PALACE, CANGYAN SEA

07:56.640 --> 07:58.720
- Greetings, my lord.
- Greetings, my lord.

07:58.800 --> 08:00.640
- Greetings, my lord.
- Greetings, my lord.

08:16.360 --> 08:17.240
Please rise.

08:29.240 --> 08:31.920
To congratulate my lord
on regaining control of the Moon Tribe,

08:32.000 --> 08:34.960
I have prepared a great gift.

08:35.039 --> 08:35.919
Bring him up.

08:49.640 --> 08:50.520
He's…

08:50.600 --> 08:51.720
My lord.

08:52.760 --> 08:53.680
For 30,000 years,

08:53.760 --> 08:56.040
the Fairy Tribe has repeatedly invaded
the Moon Tribe.

08:56.600 --> 08:57.800
They've been trying to kill us.

08:58.440 --> 09:01.000
Recently, they've sent spies
to Cangyan Sea

09:02.280 --> 09:03.440
to spy on the military.

09:05.040 --> 09:06.400
You said he's from the Fairy Tribe?

09:06.480 --> 09:07.400
That's right.

09:08.160 --> 09:10.160
This man is the leader of the spies.

09:11.040 --> 09:12.520
He was captured by me.

09:15.320 --> 09:16.200
I…

09:19.440 --> 09:21.040
This is my welcome ceremony.

09:21.640 --> 09:23.320
What are you doing here with a fairy?

09:23.400 --> 09:25.200
I'm presenting the spy

09:25.280 --> 09:28.360
to follow the ancient ritual
of making a fairy sacrifice to our flag

09:28.440 --> 09:29.760
and celebrating your return

09:30.320 --> 09:31.760
with the blood of fairies.

09:48.000 --> 09:49.280
Please do it, my lord.

09:50.520 --> 09:52.200
You want me to kill him?

10:01.760 --> 10:03.200
I mean,

10:03.760 --> 10:05.200
this is a great day.

10:05.800 --> 10:08.560
It’s not good to see blood, right?

10:10.040 --> 10:10.880
My lord.

10:11.880 --> 10:13.080
On such a joyous occasion,

10:13.720 --> 10:16.240
what could be a better boost to our morale

10:16.800 --> 10:19.720
than your victory over a fairy?

10:21.520 --> 10:25.760
My lord, please kill the fairy
to boost the morale of the army.

11:01.160 --> 11:02.400
I mean,

11:02.480 --> 11:04.600
if you're willing to submit
to Cangyan Sea,

11:05.160 --> 11:06.560
I'll spare your life.

11:06.640 --> 11:07.560
How is that?

11:09.080 --> 11:10.120
Surrender.

11:11.840 --> 11:12.720
How dare you?

11:12.800 --> 11:14.120
How dare you desecrate my lord?

11:15.520 --> 11:17.400
My lord,
there's no need to talk to him anymore.

11:18.200 --> 11:19.280
Kill him.

11:19.800 --> 11:23.640
- Kill him!
- Kill him!

11:32.920 --> 11:33.840
All right.

11:34.880 --> 11:37.400
You have the courage and grace.

11:37.960 --> 11:39.920
I'll fulfill your wish.

12:05.200 --> 12:06.120
Someone.

12:07.120 --> 12:08.040
Take him away.

12:08.120 --> 12:09.280
No need.

12:09.360 --> 12:11.000
What kind of trick are you trying to play?

12:11.800 --> 12:13.240
As a member of the Fairy Tribe,

12:13.840 --> 12:15.080
I'm loyal to Shuiyuntian.

12:15.680 --> 12:17.960
I’d rather die than surrender
to the Moon Tribe.

12:47.000 --> 12:50.680
Although we are at odds with Shuiyuntian,

12:51.640 --> 12:55.200
we also admire a true, resolute warrior.

12:56.000 --> 12:57.720
If you had become a traitor today,

12:58.200 --> 13:00.560
I would have beheaded you on the spot.

13:00.640 --> 13:02.280
But you're willing to die and not give in.

13:02.360 --> 13:04.880
That has changed my mind.

13:07.280 --> 13:08.440
Send him back to Shuiyuntian.

13:08.520 --> 13:09.440
My lord.

13:09.520 --> 13:12.080
I'm the Moon Supreme of the three realms.

13:12.880 --> 13:16.560
If I kill a true warrior
who has no power to fight back today,

13:17.320 --> 13:20.400
wouldn't the three realms
hold me up to ridicule if word gets out?

13:21.600 --> 13:22.880
If I want to kill,

13:22.960 --> 13:26.320
I'll do it on the battlefield righteously.

13:40.160 --> 13:41.080
You can go now.

13:41.800 --> 13:43.840
Go back and tell Lord Yunzhong.

13:43.920 --> 13:45.720
When we meet in future battles,

13:46.280 --> 13:48.360
I won't be lenient.

13:50.520 --> 13:51.440
Take him away.

13:51.520 --> 13:52.480
- Yes.
- Yes.

13:59.240 --> 14:00.600
My goodness.

14:08.760 --> 14:10.600
These people are so scary.

14:10.680 --> 14:11.640
They fight and kill.

14:11.720 --> 14:13.000
They look fierce and vicious.

14:13.600 --> 14:15.680
It doesn’t seem easy
to be the Moon Supreme.

14:15.760 --> 14:17.600
My lord,
you still have some matters to handle.

14:17.680 --> 14:19.680
- Do you want to--
- What did you say?

14:19.760 --> 14:21.440
I'm tired. I need to go back and rest now.

14:24.400 --> 14:25.320
Yes.

14:33.840 --> 14:34.720
Stop right there.

14:36.880 --> 14:38.960
I want to see the Moon Supreme.

14:40.880 --> 14:42.800
People from Shuiyuntian are so daring

14:42.880 --> 14:44.440
that you're still thinking

14:44.520 --> 14:46.520
of throwing yourself at my lord even now.

14:46.600 --> 14:47.600
What a pity.

14:47.680 --> 14:49.680
How could my lord like
such a mediocre woman?

14:49.760 --> 14:50.640
That's right.

14:57.520 --> 14:58.440
Let go of me.

15:00.160 --> 15:01.040
How dare you trick me?

15:01.120 --> 15:02.520
Damn you. Open the door.

15:24.320 --> 15:25.480
My lord, take a good rest.

15:26.600 --> 15:27.520
Wait.

15:29.800 --> 15:31.000
Who are they?

15:32.040 --> 15:32.880
My lord.

15:33.400 --> 15:34.600
They are your guards.

15:35.320 --> 15:38.040
I know you're very powerful,
but you've just returned to Cangyan Sea.

15:38.120 --> 15:39.400
Everything is still in turmoil.

15:39.480 --> 15:40.600
I'm afraid there might be a hidden plot.

15:40.680 --> 15:42.280
So I've specially arranged--

15:42.360 --> 15:43.880
With so many men in my bedroom,

15:45.800 --> 15:47.320
how can I possibly rest?

15:47.880 --> 15:48.840
Yes.

15:48.920 --> 15:49.840
Stand down.

15:49.920 --> 15:50.800
- Yes.
- Yes.

16:21.600 --> 16:23.360
I'm in his body.

16:23.440 --> 16:25.160
How can I go back to Shuiyuntian?

16:26.120 --> 16:28.080
How will people believe
that Dongfang Qingcang

16:28.160 --> 16:30.000
swapped bodies with a little fairy?

16:31.960 --> 16:33.800
What should I do?

16:38.680 --> 16:40.000
Even if they do believe you,

16:40.080 --> 16:42.200
how can you prove
that you are not from the Moon Tribe

16:42.280 --> 16:44.040
or a spy of the Moon Tribe?

16:47.480 --> 16:49.200
- My lord.
- My goodness.

16:50.360 --> 16:51.560
My lord.

16:52.800 --> 16:53.680
My lord.

16:53.760 --> 16:54.840
My lord.

16:54.920 --> 16:55.920
My lord.

17:00.360 --> 17:02.520
She's the woman brought back
by the Moon Supreme.

17:02.600 --> 17:05.119
- If you kill her--
- If we don’t kill her and she tells on us,

17:05.200 --> 17:06.520
neither of us can survive.

17:14.960 --> 17:16.000
My lord.

17:16.079 --> 17:17.040
My lord.

17:19.359 --> 17:20.680
- Come on.
- My lord.

17:20.760 --> 17:22.800
- We are here to serve you in bed.
- Come on.

17:23.720 --> 17:25.240
All of you, get out.

17:25.319 --> 17:26.240
My lord.

17:27.160 --> 17:29.120
Let me serve you, my lord.

17:30.840 --> 17:33.160
Out of the way!

17:33.240 --> 17:35.320
Stand down!

17:36.280 --> 17:37.720
- Yes.
- Yes.

17:48.360 --> 17:50.480
Why didn't my lord let us serve him?

17:50.560 --> 17:51.440
That's right.

17:55.240 --> 17:56.560
He threw me out.

17:56.640 --> 17:58.240
- That's odd.
- We shouldn't have come here.

17:59.440 --> 18:00.400
What’s going on?

18:02.360 --> 18:03.240
Lord Shangque.

18:03.800 --> 18:04.640
Lord Shangque.

18:04.720 --> 18:06.960
We went to the chamber
to serve Moon Supreme just now,

18:07.040 --> 18:10.080
but unexpectedly, he threw us out.

18:10.840 --> 18:12.880
You are his only former minister.

18:12.960 --> 18:14.120
You must know him well.

18:14.800 --> 18:16.720
Have we done something wrong

18:16.800 --> 18:18.120
that angered him?

18:18.680 --> 18:19.800
What you don't know is that

18:19.880 --> 18:21.880
he has never been close to women.

18:21.960 --> 18:23.480
If you are not called in the future,

18:23.560 --> 18:25.360
don't go serve him on your own accord.

18:25.920 --> 18:28.160
Lord Shangque, the Moon Supreme
invites you into his room.

18:29.680 --> 18:30.560
Now?

18:31.400 --> 18:32.600
Yes.

18:36.120 --> 18:37.800
- I heard it too.
- Is it true?

18:38.600 --> 18:40.600
- Is that true?
- That's impossible.

18:43.320 --> 18:44.240
Is that true?

18:44.760 --> 18:45.600
Shut up.

18:46.520 --> 18:47.920
If you dare to talk nonsense again,

18:48.480 --> 18:50.400
I'll cut off your tongues.

18:55.600 --> 18:56.680
Greetings, my lord.

18:59.480 --> 19:00.760
Come here.

19:02.040 --> 19:04.920
I'm willing to die for you, my lord.

19:10.040 --> 19:12.120
I just want to ask you something
about the old days.

19:13.400 --> 19:15.320
Why do you look so reluctant?

19:24.400 --> 19:25.800
What do you want to ask me?

19:30.160 --> 19:31.000
Let me ask you.

19:31.720 --> 19:32.960
In your eyes,

19:33.040 --> 19:35.960
what kind of person did I use to be?

19:37.640 --> 19:40.000
Did I have any special hobbies

19:40.880 --> 19:42.400
and preferences?

19:42.480 --> 19:44.320
How did I act in general?

19:45.120 --> 19:46.600
Tell me what you think of me.

19:47.120 --> 19:48.600
You can say anything you want.

19:49.640 --> 19:52.240
Why are you asking this?

19:57.200 --> 20:00.040
Actually, I suffered some injuries

20:00.520 --> 20:01.520
during the battle.

20:03.040 --> 20:06.040
My memory has been affected.

20:06.720 --> 20:08.640
I can't remember many old things.

20:11.160 --> 20:15.160
Has your magic power been damaged?

20:16.960 --> 20:18.480
Magic power?

20:20.000 --> 20:22.160
Of course it's damaged.

20:23.040 --> 20:25.200
In fact, that day in Wind Plain,

20:25.280 --> 20:27.200
I used up all my strength

20:27.680 --> 20:30.440
to deter Xunfeng and the others.

20:34.080 --> 20:36.520
Now, my power is intermittent.

20:37.720 --> 20:40.760
I'm afraid I'm no match for
the Kings of North and South You.

20:41.640 --> 20:42.520
My lord.

20:43.280 --> 20:45.160
Does anyone else know about this?

20:46.040 --> 20:47.440
If there is someone else who knows,

20:49.080 --> 20:50.320
I'll go and silence him.

20:50.400 --> 20:52.520
Silence him? Is it so serious?

20:52.600 --> 20:54.640
No, you're the only one who knows now.

20:57.280 --> 20:58.520
I'm afraid you have forgotten.

21:00.000 --> 21:03.760
Cangyan Sea has always admired the strong.

21:04.960 --> 21:07.120
The two kings have surrendered to you

21:07.640 --> 21:09.640
for the exact fear of your great power.

21:10.560 --> 21:12.480
If they know that your power is damaged,

21:13.280 --> 21:15.320
they will turn against you
and take your place.

21:16.200 --> 21:17.040
In that case,

21:18.120 --> 21:19.400
my lord, you'll be

21:20.320 --> 21:21.720
in an even more dangerous situation.

21:24.760 --> 21:25.840
What about your power?

21:25.920 --> 21:26.800
Can you defeat them?

21:26.880 --> 21:28.080
Can you protect me?

21:30.080 --> 21:32.920
I can't win if I fight alone.

21:34.200 --> 21:35.200
Why are you here?

21:35.800 --> 21:37.480
What are you waiting for? Help…

21:37.560 --> 21:38.440
My lord.

21:38.520 --> 21:39.480
You…

21:40.400 --> 21:41.240
Get out.

21:41.320 --> 21:43.200
How did you get out of Wind Prison?

21:44.760 --> 21:46.640
I’m going to make out
with the Moon Supreme now.

21:46.720 --> 21:48.080
Are you going to watch from there?

21:49.080 --> 21:50.080
You can’t leave!

21:55.360 --> 21:57.120
Help me!

21:59.600 --> 22:00.720
I'm leaving.

22:04.760 --> 22:07.040
Help me!

22:08.880 --> 22:09.760
Get up.

22:12.400 --> 22:13.320
Don’t come up.

22:14.840 --> 22:17.600
Help me!

22:32.080 --> 22:33.640
I said there should be lightning.

22:33.720 --> 22:35.160
You've kissed and hugged me.

22:35.240 --> 22:36.160
Are we swapped back?

22:47.280 --> 22:50.240
Why don't you just accept the reality
and keep the status quo for now?

22:50.800 --> 22:52.440
Keep the status quo?

22:54.200 --> 22:55.920
You're getting used to it so fast.

23:02.920 --> 23:03.800
That's right.

23:05.280 --> 23:08.800
You can even use my body
to find a man to sleep with.

23:09.920 --> 23:11.520
You should be happy.

23:13.480 --> 23:15.800
Should I look for you
rather than someone else?

23:16.360 --> 23:17.360
That's right.

23:18.400 --> 23:21.240
You always pretend
to be so proud and aloof.

23:21.320 --> 23:22.960
I didn't realize you had a lot of women.

23:24.800 --> 23:26.040
Have I ever had a woman?

23:26.120 --> 23:27.280
Yes, you do.

23:28.840 --> 23:30.960
When I say no, I mean no.

23:31.040 --> 23:32.200
You're still pretending.

23:32.280 --> 23:33.520
What is there to deny?

23:37.400 --> 23:39.840
I don't need to prove my innocence to you.

23:41.560 --> 23:42.440
That's right.

23:43.080 --> 23:45.960
Anyway, you already said
you don't have any love for me.

23:46.040 --> 23:47.520
Your affair is none of my business.

23:47.600 --> 23:48.680
I'm not even interested.

23:50.800 --> 23:52.160
It’s good that you know.

23:57.320 --> 24:00.080
You still have the energy
to bicker with me.

24:01.080 --> 24:03.080
Are you aware of the situation
that you and I are in?

24:06.680 --> 24:07.800
Stupid woman.

24:09.040 --> 24:10.800
You've been pretending to be me all day.

24:11.400 --> 24:12.360
Didn't you notice?

24:13.600 --> 24:16.120
Once someone finds out
I've swapped bodies with you

24:16.680 --> 24:20.000
and I'm a powerless loser now,

24:21.400 --> 24:24.840
you and I will both die.

24:27.280 --> 24:28.280
It's just a fluke

24:28.880 --> 24:30.480
that you're still alive.

24:37.360 --> 24:42.320
You’re scaring me on purpose, right?

24:48.480 --> 24:51.040
So what should we do now?

24:52.280 --> 24:53.160
Swap back.

24:55.200 --> 24:58.520
I told you there's no lightning now.

25:00.600 --> 25:02.120
I have great power.

25:03.160 --> 25:04.760
Now that you've taken my body,

25:05.280 --> 25:07.000
you can't even make a mere lightning bolt…

25:07.560 --> 25:09.280
That's right. I'll try.

25:31.040 --> 25:32.240
What a loser.

25:33.240 --> 25:35.360
It's not the first day
for you to know this.

25:35.440 --> 25:37.480
You can't call up lightning either now,
can you?

25:38.240 --> 25:39.160
Don’t just accuse me.

25:39.240 --> 25:40.440
You should think of a way too.

25:42.680 --> 25:44.360
I watched the sky when I came.

25:45.160 --> 25:46.320
In three days,

25:46.880 --> 25:48.360
there will be thunder and lightning.

25:48.960 --> 25:50.600
At that time, lightning will show up.

25:51.800 --> 25:52.720
However,

25:54.960 --> 25:56.320
during these three days,

25:56.880 --> 25:58.800
you must be careful
with your words and actions.

26:00.400 --> 26:02.680
Do as I tell you to do.

26:07.560 --> 26:08.400
Remember.

26:09.800 --> 26:12.080
If you reveal a flaw in front of anyone,

26:13.560 --> 26:16.000
both of us will die
without a burial place.

26:17.520 --> 26:18.400
Do you understand?

26:25.320 --> 26:26.360
Are you sure about this?

26:27.400 --> 26:28.720
- Come on.
- I beg you.

26:28.800 --> 26:30.280
- Don't be shy.
- Get out.

26:30.360 --> 26:31.800
- No need to serve me.
- Come on.

26:31.880 --> 26:33.640
- All of you, get out.
- My lord.

26:33.720 --> 26:37.640
You said the Destiny Book
was with Dongfang Qingcang?

26:38.200 --> 26:39.080
I saw it clearly.

26:39.160 --> 26:40.120
I couldn't be mistaken.

26:48.680 --> 26:49.520
Master.

26:49.600 --> 26:51.840
Dongfang Qingcang must have confirmed
through the Destiny Book

26:51.920 --> 26:54.240
that Red Spirit is the reincarnation
of God of War.

26:55.160 --> 26:58.040
But why didn't he just take the spirit
and unseal 100,000 soldiers?

27:00.800 --> 27:02.760
Something must be in his way.

27:05.120 --> 27:07.800
It seems that if we want to retrieve
the Destiny Book and the goddess,

27:08.960 --> 27:11.560
we must first get rid
of Dongfang Qingcang.

27:12.120 --> 27:14.680
But he's very powerful.

27:14.760 --> 27:16.680
We are no match for him.

27:17.800 --> 27:19.560
Profound as his power is,

27:20.720 --> 27:22.840
he can't resist the erosion
of evil spirits.

27:22.920 --> 27:24.400
The evil spirit has boundless power,

27:24.480 --> 27:26.360
but Dongfang Qingcang is alert
and suspicious by nature.

27:27.000 --> 27:29.680
All of our spies
have been cleared out by him.

27:29.760 --> 27:31.120
No one can get close to him.

27:34.280 --> 27:36.080
There is one more person who can help me.

27:36.720 --> 27:40.880
DARK PINE FOREST, CANGYAN SEA

27:50.680 --> 27:52.360
Lord Xunfeng,
I'm sorry to keep you waiting.

28:01.840 --> 28:02.800
Hold your head high.

28:03.360 --> 28:07.240
Show imposing and condescending manners.

28:10.920 --> 28:11.920
How was that?

28:18.200 --> 28:19.120
Watch your eyes.

28:20.120 --> 28:22.520
When you don't know
how to deal with people,

28:23.080 --> 28:24.520
just stare at them coldly

28:25.160 --> 28:26.840
and make them feel intimidated.

28:27.760 --> 28:28.720
Like this.

28:43.040 --> 28:44.440
What are you laughing at?

28:45.800 --> 28:49.280
I just think it's funny

28:49.360 --> 28:51.280
to see my face

28:51.360 --> 28:52.360
looking so terrifying.

28:56.160 --> 28:59.080
I'm just a little fairy.

29:00.120 --> 29:02.280
I basically nod and bow to people.

29:02.360 --> 29:04.200
I don't know how to be imposing,

29:04.800 --> 29:06.840
not to mention condescending.

29:07.600 --> 29:08.480
I'm tired.

29:16.960 --> 29:17.800
Fine.

29:19.000 --> 29:20.240
You just have to remember.

29:20.320 --> 29:22.160
You should be afraid of no one

29:22.240 --> 29:23.560
and trust no one.

29:27.760 --> 29:28.800
What about Shangque?

29:28.880 --> 29:30.200
Isn't Shangque your confidant?

29:30.280 --> 29:31.400
Can’t you trust him either?

29:31.960 --> 29:33.400
I only trust myself.

29:39.360 --> 29:40.520
If I were you,

29:40.600 --> 29:43.320
I would tell Shangque about the body swap

29:43.880 --> 29:45.680
so that we can work together.

29:45.760 --> 29:47.760
I'm sure we'll find a way
to swap our bodies back.

29:49.120 --> 29:50.560
How naive.

29:52.040 --> 29:54.000
The strong is admired in Cangyan Sea.

29:54.640 --> 29:56.760
If word of the body swap gets out,

29:57.400 --> 29:59.280
I'm afraid everyone would want
to challenge you

29:59.360 --> 30:00.880
to become the new Moon Supreme.

30:01.520 --> 30:03.720
You can’t activate the power in my body.

30:04.320 --> 30:07.360
Not to mention Shangque or Xunfeng,

30:07.960 --> 30:10.600
even a mere moon warrior

30:11.200 --> 30:13.120
can easily kill you at that time.

30:15.800 --> 30:16.960
I don’t think so.

30:17.920 --> 30:20.880
I think Shangque
is quite affectionate to you.

30:20.960 --> 30:22.520
He will never betray you.

30:24.440 --> 30:25.600
What do you know?

30:26.680 --> 30:27.960
I just know.

30:28.040 --> 30:29.280
You don't understand the heart

30:29.360 --> 30:30.320
and emotions.

30:30.400 --> 30:31.640
That's why you don't know.

30:34.040 --> 30:35.040
Big Blockhead.

30:35.560 --> 30:36.480
Let me ask you.

30:37.320 --> 30:40.680
Is there a rule in Cangyan Sea that says

30:41.240 --> 30:43.640
the stronger winner must kill the loser?

30:46.080 --> 30:47.320
There is no such rule.

30:49.720 --> 30:50.880
Why do you ask?

30:50.960 --> 30:52.440
Nothing.

30:52.520 --> 30:54.080
I'm just asking.

30:55.560 --> 30:56.520
Tell me.

31:03.680 --> 31:05.720
You asked me to say it.

31:05.800 --> 31:07.560
Don’t turn your back on me if I do.

31:11.200 --> 31:13.360
I just think it's strange.

31:13.920 --> 31:15.720
If you didn't have to kill him,

31:16.480 --> 31:19.280
why did you kill your father

31:19.880 --> 31:21.680
after you won against him?

31:26.880 --> 31:29.040
Lord of Haishi,
you came here late at night.

31:29.120 --> 31:30.640
What for?

31:30.720 --> 31:32.400
I heard that Dongfang Qingcang

31:32.480 --> 31:34.640
has come back from the dead
and returned to Cangyan Sea.

31:35.240 --> 31:37.560
I'm worried about you.
That's why I dropped by.

31:37.640 --> 31:39.960
I was ordered
to be the Moon Supreme to quell crises.

31:40.560 --> 31:42.560
Even if Dongfang Qingcang
is concerned about this,

31:42.640 --> 31:44.960
he can't find any reason to kill me.

31:53.240 --> 31:54.400
Thirty thousand years ago,

31:55.040 --> 31:58.080
if the Wind Warriors led by you

31:58.160 --> 31:59.440
had helped in time,

31:59.520 --> 32:02.720
Dongfang Qingcang wouldn't
have been left alone on the battlefield.

32:03.280 --> 32:05.440
If Dongfang Qingcang pursues the case

32:05.520 --> 32:07.680
and claims that you had been disobedient,

32:08.280 --> 32:09.920
how will you defend yourself,
Lord Xunfeng?

32:15.800 --> 32:16.760
However,

32:16.840 --> 32:20.120
you and Dongfang Qingcang
are blood-related.

32:20.800 --> 32:22.960
If you can proactively show kindness

32:23.040 --> 32:24.160
and put aside your hatred,

32:24.240 --> 32:27.040
maybe Dongfang Qingcang
will forget about the past.

32:27.680 --> 32:29.120
After all, 30,000 years have passed.

32:30.280 --> 32:34.160
You should have let go of the grudge
of your father's death.

32:52.480 --> 32:54.280
It's unforgivable whatsoever.

32:54.840 --> 32:56.240
How can I just let go of it?

32:56.800 --> 32:58.480
Even if I lose my life,

32:59.040 --> 33:00.640
I shall kill him with my own hands

33:01.480 --> 33:03.120
to console my father's spirit.

33:03.600 --> 33:05.400
Why bother, Lord Xunfeng?

33:05.880 --> 33:07.800
From the day he killed my father,

33:08.600 --> 33:10.480
our fates have been sealed.

33:11.960 --> 33:14.640
Either he dies or I die.

33:17.640 --> 33:21.280
Back then, it was you
who helped me build Haishi.

33:22.360 --> 33:25.640
I'll always remember your kindness.

33:27.520 --> 33:29.520
Now, if you have made up your mind,

33:30.520 --> 33:34.280
I'll do everything I can
to help you achieve your wish.

33:34.760 --> 33:35.800
I’m afraid it won't be easy

33:37.040 --> 33:38.320
to kill him.

33:42.200 --> 33:44.120
Lord Xunfeng, do you not trust me?

33:49.400 --> 33:50.880
Have you forgotten, Lord Xunfeng?

33:52.600 --> 33:53.960
Over 30,000 years ago,

33:54.600 --> 33:57.040
it was me who helped you plan

33:57.120 --> 33:59.600
the counterbalance between
the Kings of North and South You

33:59.680 --> 34:01.080
to save Ninth You.

34:01.160 --> 34:02.400
Now,

34:03.400 --> 34:05.880
I can also help you kill Dongfang Qingcang

34:06.520 --> 34:07.880
to avenge the death of your father.

34:07.960 --> 34:09.199
Fortunately,

34:10.080 --> 34:12.159
you've been planning in secret
all these years.

34:12.239 --> 34:15.440
If it weren't for your foresight
and maneuvering,

34:15.520 --> 34:17.239
I'm afraid the foundation
built by my father

34:18.159 --> 34:20.520
would have been taken away
by the two kings.

34:22.239 --> 34:26.000
It's just that Dongfang Qingcang
is very powerful

34:26.719 --> 34:28.120
and ruthless.

34:29.320 --> 34:31.800
Without the means to kill him in one blow,

34:33.199 --> 34:34.880
you must not act rashly

34:35.719 --> 34:37.920
and alert him.

34:41.159 --> 34:43.360
I'll help you kill Dongfang Qingcang.

34:44.120 --> 34:45.120
However,

34:45.199 --> 34:47.280
we have to consider this in the long run

34:47.360 --> 34:49.000
and wait for the right time.

35:08.400 --> 35:11.480
Father!

35:33.680 --> 35:34.520
Only by killing him

35:34.600 --> 35:37.480
will I be able to secure the position
as the new Moon Supreme.

35:38.800 --> 35:40.120
What's so strange about that?

35:41.120 --> 35:44.040
I never thought the rumor
that you killed your father is true.

35:45.400 --> 35:47.640
Then why isn't there any trace of pain

35:47.720 --> 35:49.600
or regret on your face

35:50.120 --> 35:51.480
when you mention it?

35:52.040 --> 35:53.040
Regret?

35:55.520 --> 35:57.280
Why should I regret it?

35:58.400 --> 36:00.000
He's your father.

36:00.560 --> 36:01.480
So what?

36:09.040 --> 36:12.440
I've always dreamed
of having a family and parents.

36:13.560 --> 36:16.040
You had a father,
but you killed him with your own hands.

36:17.400 --> 36:20.640
People say you're a coldhearted jerk
who doesn’t recognize your own family.

36:22.240 --> 36:23.720
I thought people got you wrong.

36:23.800 --> 36:24.800
That's right.

36:25.600 --> 36:27.120
I'm a jerk.

36:28.960 --> 36:30.000
Now,

36:37.120 --> 36:38.840
if you don't want to die,

36:40.320 --> 36:43.040
you must learn how to be a jerk.

36:50.240 --> 36:51.280
What are you doing?

36:51.920 --> 36:52.760
Come here.

36:56.600 --> 36:57.440
Let go.

36:59.640 --> 37:01.520
I'm a beautiful fairy with a good heart.

37:01.600 --> 37:02.960
I don’t want to be a jerk.

37:04.800 --> 37:05.960
Get out of here.

37:07.080 --> 37:07.920
Watch her.

37:08.000 --> 37:09.680
Don't let her in without my order.

37:09.760 --> 37:10.600
- Yes.
- Yes.

37:11.680 --> 37:12.560
You…

37:15.400 --> 37:16.280
Go.
